OL,3,GNEWSAI was trapped in a cave for 54
OL,4,Ahours but made it my mission to get
OL,5,Aback underground
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man trapped for 54 hours in the UK's
OL,8,Flongest cave rescue said it was his
OL,9,Fmission to "get back underground" as
OL,10,Fsoon as possible.
OL,12,FGeorge Linnane from Bristol was
OL,13,Fexploring deep in the Ogof Ffynnon Ddu
OL,14,Fcave system in Bannau Brycheiniog
OL,15,FNational Park - also known as the
OL,16,FBrecon Beacons - with friends when he
OL,17,Ffell, breaking a leg, his jaw and three
OL,18,Fribs.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
