OL,3,GNEWSAI was trapped in a cave for 54
OL,4,Ahours but made it my mission to get
OL,5,Aback underground
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I always wanted to get back
OL,8,Funderground. I kind of made it my
OL,9,Fmission. I decided this very early on
OL,10,Fwhilst I was still in the hospital,"
OL,11,Fsaid the 43-year-old.
OL,13,FAfter nine months of recovery and
OL,14,Fslowly building up his physical
OL,15,Ffitness, Linnane was able to return to
OL,16,Fhis adventurous hobby, even revisiting
OL,17,Fthe cave where he fell in November
OL,18,F2021.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
